  "explain": {
   "ko": "표를 살 때는 A ticket to + 장소, please를 씁니다. single은 편도, return은 왕복입니다. 시간을 물을 때는 What time does the train leave?라고 하고, 시간표에 있는 일은 현재형으로 말합니다: The train leaves at ten.",
   "en": "To buy a ticket say A ticket to + place, please. Single means one way and return means both ways. Ask the time with What time does the train leave? and give timetable times in the present simple: The train leaves at ten."
  },
